      "description": "The MicroSectors 3x Long Consumer Staples (XLP) ETNs Structured Note (XLPU) is an exchange-traded product that mostly invests in consumer staples equity. The ETNs seek to provide three times leveraged participation in the VettaFi US Consumer Staples Fund-Tracking Index (the Index) from one leverage reset day to the next, before taking into account fees and charges. XLPU was launched on Sep 10, 2026 and is issued by MicroSectors.",
